MIP_FOREIGN + ECONAPP_ECONMIP + FPAPP_ECONFP +
APPROVE_L1 + PARTY_IN + PARTY_OUT + UNRATE +
DIVIDEDGOV + ELECTION + HONEYMOON + as.factor(PRESIDENT.num), data = approval)
